<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Supervalu raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Supervalu raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs raised its recommendation on Supervalu Inc to trading buy from market perform, according to a Goldman Sachs source.</p>
<p>-- In early New York Stock Exchange trade, the shares rose 3/4 to 28-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
